ling wine. The term itself does not require translation, as it is recognized internationally. However, if you want to provide context for English-speaking diners, you could say:\n\n\"Penedés: A prestigious wine region in Catalonia, celebrated for its exceptional wines, especially Cava, a traditional sparkling wine.\"","is_specialty":false,"price_unit_2":null,"display_order":1,"is_suggestion":false,"dish_allergens":[],"price_unit_suffix":null,"price_unit_2_suffix":null},{"id":"1991c0c7-7422-4c1b-85f0-a10aef6b732f","name":"Terrer de La Creu Brut Nature","price_1":22,"price_2":null,"image_url":null,"deleted_at":null,"is_visible":true,"price_unit":null,"description":"\"Cava\" refers to a sparkling wine from Spain, primarily produced in the Catalonia region. It is made using the traditional method (Método Tradicional), similar to that used for Champagne, where the wine undergoes a second fermentation in the bottle. Cava is typically made from indigenous grape varieties such as Macabeo, Xarel-lo, and Parellada, giving it a unique flavor profile that can range from fruity and floral to nutty and complex. It is often enjoyed as an aperitif or paired with a variety of dishes, making it a versatile choice for any dining occasion.","is_specialty":false,"price_unit_2":null,"display_order":0,"is_suggestion":false,"dish_allergens":[],"price_unit_suffix":null,"price_unit_2_suffix":null}],"image_url":null,"deleted_at":null,"is_visible":true,"description":null,"display_order":0,"price_header_1":"Precio","price_header_2":null,"prices_visible":true,"parent_group_id":null,"has_dual_pricing":false},{"id":"79ce47ff-8080-466c-b25a-27b2c69645b8","name":"\"Red wines\"","dishes":[{"id":"1593ad27-a3e7-4fc3-9b14-19cc4475e7c1","name":"Valdecontina","price_1":19,"price_2":null,"image_url":null,"deleted_at":null,"is_visible":true,"price_unit":null,"description":"\"D.O. Bierzo\" translates to \"Denomination of Origin Bierzo.\" This refers to a specific wine region in Spain known for its high-quali